## Adding Components

Create new Vue components in the `src/components` directory:

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
// Component logic
</script>

<template>
  <!-- Component template -->
</template>

<style scoped>
/* Component styles */
</style>
```

## Adding Stores

Create new Pinia stores in the `src/stores` directory:

```typescript
import { defineStore } from 'pinia';

export const useStoreName = defineStore('storeName', {
  state: () => ({
    // State properties
  }),
  actions: {
    // Actions
  },
  getters: {
    // Getters
  },
});
```

## Environment Variables

Create a `.env` file in the project root for environment-specific variables:

```
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
VITE_APP_TITLE=My App
```

Access environment variables in your code with `import.meta.env.VITE_*`

## Deployment

### Vercel

```bash
npm install -g vercel
vercel
```

### Netlify

```bash
npm install -g netlify-cli
netlify deploy
```

### Railway

```bash
npm install -g @railway/cli
railway init
railway up
```

